# The FastAPI backend lives OUTSIDE this folder, at ../portfolio-backend.
#
# It has to. Vercel auto-scans the project root and detects any Python app
# as a second "service" (FastAPI), then refuses to honour the top-level
# build settings because it can no longer tell which service owns them.
# Keeping the API in its own directory makes this a plain static deploy.
#
# The contact form detects the missing API and falls back to mailto: —
# see src/components/Contact.jsx and src/lib/api.js.

# Vercel builds from source — no need to upload these
node_modules/
dist/
README.md
